- crypto: authenc - use memcpy_sglist() instead of null skcipher (Eric Biggers)
- crypto: algif_aead - snapshot IV for async AEAD requests (Douya Le)
- crypto: algif_aead - Revert to operating out-of-place (Herbert Xu)
- crypto: algif_aead - use memcpy_sglist() instead of null skcipher (Eric Biggers)
- crypto: scatterwalk - Backport memcpy_sglist() (Eric Biggers)

